idth:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="22.4" y="34" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">20</text><text x="205.7" y="274" font-size="14" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">t / s</text><text x="25.4" y="14" font-size="14" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">v / m s⁻¹</text><polyline points="29.4,200.4 293.9,75.6 382,138" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/></svg>', 'A v–t graph rising in a straight line from 4.0 m s⁻¹ to 16 m s⁻¹ in 6.0 s, then falling to 10 m s⁻¹ at 8.0 s.'),
('6d36df3d-e9f6-5194-9945-0ec411d09004', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '8ba3439e-0247-4a40-8f47-a5945e5c2968', 'a-level', '2.1', '9702 coursebook 2.1 · The meaning of acceleration', 50, 50, 'A cyclist accelerates from 3.0 m s⁻¹ at 0.50 m s⁻² for 12 s, then brakes at 2.5 m s⁻². (a) Calculate her speed after 12 s. (b) Calculate the braking time to stop. (c) Calculate the total time from the start of accelerating to stopping.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '15.6', 's', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) v = 3.0 + 0.50 × 12 = 9.0 m s⁻¹. (b) t = 9.0 ÷ 2.5 = 3.6 s. (c) 12 + 3.6 = 15.6 s. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: speed. M1: braking time. C1: 3.6 s. M1: total. C1: value. A1: t = 15.6 s.', 6, NULL, NULL),
('8d8e4845-422c-5386-9c3e-bed2bfb6d2e7', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '8ba3439e-0247-4a40-8f47-a5945e5c2968', 'a-level', '2.1', '9702 coursebook 2.1 · The meaning of acceleration', 51, 51, 'A ball rolls up a ramp at 5.0 m s⁻¹ and decelerates at 2.0 m s⁻². (a) Calculate when it stops. (b) Calculate its velocity 4.0 s after starting up the ramp, taking up the ramp as positive.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '-3', 'm s⁻¹', false, NULL, true, NULL, '(a) t = 5.0 ÷ 2.0 = 2.5 s. (b) v = 5.0 − 2.0 × 4.0 = −3.0 m s⁻¹, rolling back down. Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: stopping time. M1: v = u + at. C1: value. B1: sign meaning. A1: v = −3.0 m s⁻¹.', 5, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgf8c91d1a-t fgf8c91d1a-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgf8c91d1a-t">Ball on a ramp</title><desc id="fgf8c91d1a-d">A straight v–t line starting at 5.0 m s⁻¹, crossing zero at 2.5 s and continuing below the axis to 4.0 s (up the ramp positive).</desc><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="107.8" y1="34" x2="107.8" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="186.1" y1="34" x2="186.1" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="264.5" y1="34" x2="264.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="342.8" y1="34" x2="342.8" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="242" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;st