('d122e578-9ebf-5246-b52f-54715571a1b2', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '91cb1c54-423a-4525-a723-99c1e9e9bf6b', 'a-level', '2.2', '9702 coursebook 2.2 · Calculating acceleration', 29, 29, 'The same car (8.0 m s⁻¹ at 2.0 s, 20 m s⁻¹ at 6.0 s, uniform acceleration): calculate its speed at t = 0.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '2', 'm s⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'a = 12 ÷ 4.0 = 3.0 m s⁻²; u = 8.0 − 3.0 × 2.0 = 2.0 m s⁻¹. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: acceleration. C1: extrapolate back. A1: u = 2.0 m s⁻¹.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('4d4f96e8-6875-5b7a-8a29-8e5dfa5e4b55', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '91cb1c54-423a-4525-a723-99c1e9e9bf6b', 'a-level', '2.2', '9702 coursebook 2.2 · Calculating acceleration', 30, 30, 'A train decelerates uniformly from 40 m s⁻¹ to 16 m s⁻¹ in 30 s and continues at the same rate. Calculate how much longer it takes to stop.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '20', 's', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'a = (16 − 40) ÷ 30 = −0.80 m s⁻². Further time = 16 ÷ 0.80 = 20 s. Mark scheme (4 marks). C1: deceleration. M1: same rate. C1: time. A1: t = 20 s.', 4, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgf9347a20-t fgf9347a20-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgf9347a20-t">Braking train</title><desc id="fgf9347a20-d">A straight v–t line falling from 40 m s⁻¹ at t = 0 to 16 m s⁻¹ at 30 s, continued (dashed) at the same gradient to v = 0.</desc><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="93.5" y1="34" x2="93.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="157.6" y1="34" x2="157.6" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="221.7" y1="34" x2="221.7" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="285.8" y1="34" x2="285.8" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="349.9" y1="34" x2="349.9" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="242" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--