('9367b430-a81a-5b2c-beaa-5a1b90403223', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '5e4207c2-e358-4374-b5ab-92bbcb2b87e7', 'a-level', '2.4', '9702 coursebook 2.4 · Deducing acceleration', 1, 1, 'What does the gradient of a velocity–time graph represent?', NULL, 1, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'The acceleration', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Gradient = Δv/Δt, which is the acceleration. Mark scheme (1 mark). B1: C (The acceleration).', 1, NULL, NULL),
