('7c99fd00-46c2-5be6-98f5-d250d39aa579', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '5e4207c2-e358-4374-b5ab-92bbcb2b87e7', 'a-level', '2.4', '9702 coursebook 2.4 · Deducing acceleration', 43, 43, 'A bouncing ball''s v–t graph has a gradient of −9.81 m s⁻² while it is in the air (up positive). It leaves the floor at 7.0 m s⁻¹. How long until it reaches the top?', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.7136', 's', false, NULL, false, NULL, 't = 7.0 ÷ 9.81 = 0.714 s. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: v = 0 at top. C1: t = u/g. A1: t = 0.714 s.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('ef4c6d8d-a39b-5a8b-89b8-980f03074bbb', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '5e4207c2-e358-4374-b5ab-92bbcb2b87e7', 'a-level', '2.4', '9702 coursebook 2.4 · Deducing acceleration', 44, 44, 'A v–t graph: 0 to 6.0 s rises from 0 to 18 m s⁻¹; 6.0 to 10 s constant; 10 to 13 s falls to 0 (all straight). (a) Calculate the acceleration in the first section. (b) Calculate the deceleration in the last section. (c) Calculate their ratio.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.5', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) a₁ = 18 ÷ 6.0 = 3.0 m s⁻². (b) a₃ = 18 ÷ 3.0 = 6.0 m s⁻². (c) Ratio a₁ ÷ a₃ = 3.0 ÷ 6.0 = 0.50. Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: a₁. C1: a₃. M1: ratio. C1: value. A1: ratio = 0.50.', 5, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgb721adb0-t fgb721adb0-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgb721adb0-t">Three stages</title><desc id="fgb721adb0-d">A v–t graph rising to 18 m s⁻¹ in 6.0 s, constant until 10 s, falling to zero at 13 s.</desc><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="79.8" y1="34" x2="79.8" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="130.2" y1="34" x2="130.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="180.5" y1="34" x2="180.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="230.9" y1="34" x2="230.9" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="281.3" y1="34" x2="281.3" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-line