('b5fcad52-4587-5947-9302-15f843dd9dbc', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '5e4207c2-e358-4374-b5ab-92bbcb2b87e7', 'a-level', '2.4', '9702 coursebook 2.4 · Deducing acceleration', 46, 46, 'A ball dropped from rest hits the ground at 8.0 m s⁻¹ after 0.82 s and rebounds at 6.0 m s⁻¹, rising for 0.61 s. Taking down as positive: (a) calculate the gradient while falling; (b) calculate the gradient while rising; (c) comment.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '9.836', 'm s⁻²', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) 8.0 ÷ 0.82 = 9.76 m s⁻². (b) (0 − (−6.0)) ÷ 0.61 = 9.84 m s⁻². (c) Both are about g and in the same direction (down). Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: falling gradient. M1: rising with signs. C1: value. B1: both ≈ g. A1: a = 9.84 m s⁻².', 5, NULL, NULL),
('3d8e3198-f832-5d69-9798-c875d375b1f1', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '5e4207c2-e358-4374-b5ab-92bbcb2b87e7', 'a-level', '2.4', '9702 coursebook 2.4 · Deducing acceleration', 47, 47, 'Two trains pass on parallel tracks at t = 0. Train X''s v–t graph is constant at 20 m s⁻¹. Train Y''s rises from 8.0 m s⁻¹ with gradient 0.60 m s⁻². (a) Write v for each train. (b) Calculate when they have equal velocities. (c) State the gradient of X''s graph.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '20', 's', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) v_X = 20; v_Y = 8.0 + 0.60t. (b) 8.0 + 0.60t = 20 gives t = 12 ÷ 0.60 = 20 s. (c) Zero. Mark scheme (6 marks). B1: equations. M1: equate. C1: rearrange. C1: value. B1: zero gradient. A1: t = 20 s.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg0b6d73ee-t fg0b6d73ee-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg0b6d73ee-t">Trains X and Y</title><desc id="fg0b6d73ee-d">v–t graphs: train X constant at 20 m s⁻¹; train Y rising from 8.0 m s⁻¹ with gradient 0.60 m s⁻².</desc><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="147" y1="34" x2="147" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="264.5" y1="34" x2="264.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="382" y1="34" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="242" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="172.7" x2="382" y2="172.7" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,