('b3ab1ed2-0e1f-5339-b068-8b6a0fb7229a', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '5e4207c2-e358-4374-b5ab-92bbcb2b87e7', 'a-level', '2.4', '9702 coursebook 2.4 · Deducing acceleration', 49, 49, 'For a falling sphere in oil, tangents to its v–t curve give 5.0 m s⁻² at 0.10 s and 1.0 m s⁻² at 0.40 s, while v = 0.38 m s⁻¹ and 0.60 m s⁻¹ there. (a) Explain why the gradient decreases. (b) Calculate the average acceleration between 0.10 s and 0.40 s.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.7333', 'm s⁻²', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) Drag increases with speed, so the resultant force falls. (b) a = (0.60 − 0.38) ÷ (0.40 − 0.10) = 0.733 m s⁻². Mark scheme (5 marks). B1: drag increases. B1: resultant force decreases. M1: chord Δv/Δt. C1: value. A1: a = 0.733 m s⁻².', 5, NULL, NULL),
('1363ed71-bce2-5ee8-8169-be8f5b6a532c', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', '5e4207c2-e358-4374-b5ab-92bbcb2b87e7', 'a-level', '2.4', '9702 coursebook 2.4 · Deducing acceleration', 50, 50, 'A v–t graph for a lift (up positive): 0–2.0 s rises to 2.5 m s⁻¹; 2.0–8.0 s constant; 8.0–10.5 s falls to 0. (a) Calculate each acceleration. (b) State the acceleration from 2.0 s to 8.0 s. (c) Calculate the ratio of the largest to smallest non-zero magnitudes.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '1.25', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) 2.5 ÷ 2.0 = 1.25 m s⁻²; (0 − 2.5) ÷ 2.5 = −1.0 m s⁻². (b) Zero. (c) 1.25 ÷ 1.0 = 1.25. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: first. C1: last. B1: zero. M1: ratio. C1: value. A1: ratio = 1.25.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgbf10bcad-t fgbf10bcad-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgbf10bcad-t">Lift journey</title><desc id="fgbf10bcad-d">A lift v–t graph rising to 2.5 m s⁻¹ in 2.0 s, constant until 8.0 s, falling to zero at 10.5 s.</desc><line x1="24" y1="34" x2="24" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="89.1" y1="34" x2="89.1" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="154.2" y1="34" x2="154.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="219.3" y1="34" x2="219.3" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="284.4" y1="34" x2="284.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="349.5" y1="34" x2="349.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke