('ead87602-9e13-553f-960e-a777f0958ad2', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', 'c47dfb2d-b9eb-482e-b89f-aecbc8e799cc', 'a-level', '2.5', '9702 coursebook 2.5 · Deducing displacement', 35, 35, 'Using the area under a v–t graph, calculate the displacement of an object that moves from 3.0 m s⁻¹ to 9.0 m s⁻¹ with uniform acceleration 1.5 m s⁻².', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '24', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, 't = (9.0 − 3.0) ÷ 1.5 = 4.0 s; s = (3.0 + 9.0) ÷ 2 × 4.0 = 24 m. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: time from gradient. C1: area. A1: s = 24 m.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('0bb8f57d-4380-5b25-9431-82006f6653ee', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', 'c47dfb2d-b9eb-482e-b89f-aecbc8e799cc', 'a-level', '2.5', '9702 coursebook 2.5 · Deducing displacement', 36, 36, 'A cyclist rides at 8.0 m s⁻¹ for 30 s, slows uniformly to 4.0 m s⁻¹ in 10 s and rides at 4.0 m s⁻¹ for 20 s. Calculate the total distance.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '380', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, 's = 8.0 × 30 + (8.0 + 4.0) ÷ 2 × 10 + 4.0 × 20 = 380 m. Mark scheme (4 marks). C1: first rectangle. C1: trapezium. C1: second rectangle. A1: s = 380 m.', 4, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgc42b79b7-t fgc42b79b7-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgc42b79b7-t">Cyclist</title><desc id="fgc42b79b7-d">A v–t graph at 8.0 m s⁻¹ for 30 s, falling to 4.0 m s⁻¹ over 10 s, then constant for 20 s, with the area shaded.</desc><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="88.2" y1="34" x2="88.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="147" y1="34" x2="147" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="205.7" y1="34" x2="205.7" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="264.5" y1="34" x2="264.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="323.2" y1="34" x2="323.2" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="382" y1="34" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);s