('1ee19818-490a-59a5-9c86-357b4b3a92e1', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', 'c47dfb2d-b9eb-482e-b89f-aecbc8e799cc', 'a-level', '2.5', '9702 coursebook 2.5 · Deducing displacement', 50, 50, 'A ball dropped from rest falls for 0.60 s, bounces and rises for 0.40 s, taking down as positive with g = 9.81 m s⁻². (a) Calculate the speeds at impact and just after the bounce. (b) Calculate the net displacement after the 1.0 s (ignore the bounce time).', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '0.981', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) 9.81 × 0.60 = 5.89 m s⁻¹; 9.81 × 0.40 = 3.92 m s⁻¹. (b) s = 0.5 × 9.81 × 0.60² − 0.5 × 9.81 × 0.40² = 0.981 m below the release point. Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: impact speed. C1: rebound speed. M1: net area. C1: value. A1: s = 0.981 m.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('8973b345-d297-5945-abbb-8bc14f884a67', 'ec015167-65fb-47df-b565-1055132ab4f3', 'c47dfb2d-b9eb-482e-b89f-aecbc8e799cc', 'a-level', '2.5', '9702 coursebook 2.5 · Deducing displacement', 51, 51, 'The v–t graph of a car is v = 3t (m s⁻¹) for 0 ≤ t ≤ 6.0 s, then v = 18 m s⁻¹. (a) Calculate the displacement at 6.0 s. (b) Calculate the displacement at 15 s. (c) Calculate the average velocity over 15 s.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '14.4', 'm s⁻¹', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) 0.5 × 18 × 6.0 = 54 m. (b) 54 + 18 × 9.0 = 216 m. (c) 216 ÷ 15 = 14.4 m s⁻¹. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: triangle. C1: rectangle. C1: total. M1: ÷ time. C1: value. A1: v = 14.4 m s⁻¹.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 290" role="img" aria-labelledby="fge4e4f95a-t fge4e4f95a-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fge4e4f95a-t">v = 3t then constant</title><desc id="fge4e4f95a-d">A v–t graph rising as v = 3t to 18 m s⁻¹ at 6.0 s and then constant to 15 s, with the area shaded.</desc><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="29.4" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="100" y1="34" x2="100" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="170.5" y1="34" x2="170.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="241" y1="34" x2="241" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="311.5" y1="34" x2="311.5" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="382" y1="34" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="242" x2="382" y2="242" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="190" x2="382" y2="190" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="138" x2="382" y2="138" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="86" x2="382" y2="86" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="34" x2="382" y2="34" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="242" x2="388" y2="242" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><line x1="29.4" y1="242" x2="29.4" y2="28" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="392,242 385.7,245 385.7,239" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><polygon points="29.4,24 32.4,30.3 26.5,30.3" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="29.4" y1="242" x2="29.4" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="29.4" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0</text><line x1="100" y1="242" x2="100" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="100" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">3</text><line x1="170.5" y1="242" x2="170.5" y2="246" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="170.5" y="254" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="